  "is_generated": true,
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Wakey wakey.",
      "start": 2.48,
      "duration": 3.48
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Where are we?",
      "start": 8.32,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": ">> The pocket dimension.",
      "start": 9.68,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Then we can find GG.",
      "start": 12.64,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": ">> She's not here. Not physically anyway.",
      "start": 14.0,
      "duration": 7.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Eventually we'll become like that, too.",
      "start": 17.6,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Right, we started to glow.",
      "start": 23.68,
      "duration": 3.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Was that your doing?",
      "start": 26.48,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Yeah, it was protection magic. But it",
      "start": 27.56,
      "duration": 6.4
    },
    {
      "text": "won't fix everything. Sooner or later",
      "start": 31.0,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "the spell will wear off.",
      "start": 33.96,
      "duration": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Then we must escape before that happens.",
      "start": 35.76,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Uh, but I already did my steppies for",
      "start": 37.92,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "the day.",
      "start": 40.32,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Come on. I'll drag you along if I need",
      "start": 41.6,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "to.",
      "start": 44.56,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Fine.",
      "start": 46.4,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Shuri, do you have anything in your",
      "start": 53.48,
      "duration": 2.88
    },
    {
      "text": "pockets?",
      "start": 55.32,
      "duration": 2.0
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Huh?",
      "start": 56.36,
      "duration": 2.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Uh, no. Why?",
      "start": 57.32,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Some of these buildings look familiar.",
      "start": 59.28,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "We should start leaving markers to",
      "start": 61.4,
      "duration": 3.64
    },
    {
      "text": "ensure we're not moving in circles.",
      "start": 62.96,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Uh, Liz, we're in a pocket dimension.",
      "start": 65.04,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "You can't just leave marks here like",
      "start": 67.64,
      "duration": 2.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Hansel and Gretel.",
      "start": 69.12,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": ">> And there is truly nothing we can do?",
      "start": 70.32,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": ">> We could exchange stories.",
      "start": 72.88,
      "duration": 3.88
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Huh?",
      "start": 75.2,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": ">> You heard me. Go entertain me.",
      "start": 76.76,
      "duration": 3.24
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Seriously?",
      "start": 79.2,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Well, I'll share stories, too.",
      "start": 80.0,
      "duration": 7.28
    },
    {
      "text": ">> I truly do not understand you.",
      "start": 83.6,
      "duration": 7.36
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Yeah, I get that a lot.",
      "start": 87.28,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": ">> How about this, then? If we are to share",
      "start": 91.0,
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": "stories, let's start with one about why",
      "start": 93.2,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "getting you to help others or even",
      "start": 95.92,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "yourself feels like pulling teeth.",
      "start": 98.16,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": ">> You'd be dead by the time I finish that",
      "start": 100.56,
      "duration": 2.96
    },
    {
      "text": "tale.",
      "start": 102.8,
      "duration": 3.52
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Then summarize.",
      "start": 103.52,
      "duration": 2.8
    },
    {
      "text": ">> All right.",
      "start": 106.84,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": "You're talking to someone who has seen",
      "start": 109.16,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "the worst in people.",
      "start": 111.2,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm not made of infinite tears, and my",
      "start": 113.0,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "emotional bandwidth isn't as strong as",
      "start": 115.36,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "it used to be.",
      "start": 117.24,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Honestly, sometimes I wish the story",
      "start": 120.12,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "would just end.",
      "start": 123.16,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Shuri,",
      "start": 125.16,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry for what you've been through,",
      "start": 127.0,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "but it doesn't change that today and the",
      "start": 129.16,
      "duration": 5.64
    },
    {
      "text": "people that are around are important.",
      "start": 131.56,
      "duration": 5.68
    },
    {
      "text": ">> You're not the first to tell me that. At",
      "start": 134.8,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "a certain [music] point, those kind of",
      "start": 137.24,
      "duration": 3.12
    },
    {
      "text": "words lost their meaning.",
      "start": 138.92,
      "duration": 3.64
    },
    {
      "text": ">> If that were true, you wouldn't have",
      "start": 140.36,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "lifted a finger to help Nerissa.",
      "start": 142.56,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "But when the time came, you did.",
      "start": 145.08,
      "duration": 5.8
    },
    {
      "text": "You saved her. You tried to protect me.",
      "start": 147.4,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "That mattered.",
      "start": 150.88,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": ">> I'm sorry, but it actually didn't. If",
      "start": 152.08,
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "this creature doesn't just absorb the",
      "start": 155.44,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "person, it absorbs their powers.",
      "start": 157.64,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Then",
      "start": 160.76,
      "duration": 2.72
    },
    {
      "text": "because I left it to you,",
      "start": 161.88,
      "duration": 3.24
    },
    {
      "text": ">> it'll gain the forbidden knowledge of an",
      "start": 163.48,
      "duration": 3.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Archiver.",
      "start": 165.12,
      "duration": 3.52
    },
    {
      "text": "With that, the creature will be able to",
      "start": 166.6,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "overwrite our timeline.",
      "start": 168.64,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [snorts and sighs]",
      "start": 172.921,
      "duration": 2.02
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Fine, then. That simply gives me one",
      "start": 175.16,
      "duration": 6.72
    },
    {
      "text": "more reason for us to get out of here.",
      "start": 177.64,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Hey, big and ugly.",
      "start": 202.6,
      "duration": 3.639
    },
    {
      "text": "Those souls you took are rightfully",
      "start": 210.84,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "mine.",
      "start": 212.72,
      "duration": 2.64
    },
    {
      "text": ">> What? I think it just gave you one of",
      "start": 225.72,
      "duration": 6.519
    },
    {
      "text": "the souls back.",
      "start": 229.12,
      "duration": 3.119
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Is that",
      "start": 237.2,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "my Khalifa?",
      "start": 238.36,
      "duration": 2.92
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Oh god, no.",
      "start": 241.44,
      "duration": 4.2
    }
  ]
}
